{"1999850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Possessions", "steam_appid": 1999850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>Daily Demo Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Possessions for free for up to 15 minutes per day in the Daily Demo Edition. Jump into matches with other demo players as well as anyone who owns the full game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What’s Included </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to all Game Modes </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your timer only counts down while you’re in a round </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If time expires mid-round, you can finish that round </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can start new rounds as long as you haven’t exceeded your daily 15-minute limit </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timer resets daily at 3pm GMT (10am EST / 12am JST) </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo Limitations </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lobbies must use Single Round game length </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cannot join lobbies with Custom Settings enabled </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No progress toward Steam Leaderboards or Achievements</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic online asymmetric party game where your friends are the furniture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 3-9 players in a lobby, one player is the Burglar, trapped in a house by a mischievous Kitsune and forced to complete random tasks to escape. All other players  are invisible Ghosts, possessing everyday objects to ambush the Burglar, steal the body, and complete their own tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish your tasks. Escape with the body. Don’t trust the toilet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in private lobbies with friends or host publicly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a Ghost</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possess household objects and set up ambushes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your strike to take control of the body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate lights to blind and disorient the Burglar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure and taunt the Burglar with decoys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ghost’s look with colors and cosmetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as the Burglar</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your task list and find an exit</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot subtle clues to detect possessed objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge-roll to avoid ambushes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk turning the lights on or use night vision to survive the dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo other players’ progress after stealing control</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic online asymmetric party game where your friends are the furniture. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 3-9 players in a lobby, one player is the Burglar, trapped in a house by a mischievous Kitsune and forced to complete random tasks to escape. All other players  are invisible Ghosts, possessing everyday objects to ambush the Burglar, steal the body, and complete their own tasks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finish your tasks. Escape with the body. Don’t trust the toilet. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in private lobbies with friends or host publicly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as a Ghost</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Possess household objects and set up ambushes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time your strike to take control of the body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manipulate lights to blind and disorient the Burglar</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure and taunt the Burglar with decoys</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your ghost’s look with colors and cosmetics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play as the Burglar</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete your task list and find an exit</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spot subtle clues to detect possessed objects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge-roll to avoid ambushes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk turning the lights on or use night vision to survive the dark</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Undo other players’ progress after stealing control</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Trapped in a house cursed by a Kitsune and forced to play his game, you must compete with other souls to take control of a burglar's body and gain your freedom. Play as a lost soul trying to ambush the burglar by possessing household objects or as the burglar trying to finish tasks and find an exit!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999850/header.jpg?t=1785855033", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999850/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785855033", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1999850/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1